    <div class="bard-content !mb-0">
        
        <h3>Oliver! Musical Theatre Workshop</h3><p>This energetic 90-minute workshop introduces students to the characters, themes and music of Oliver!. Through drama activities, movement and choreography, participants explore the experiences of Victorian London. Students then develop vocal and performance skills while learning extracts from the iconic songs <em>Food, Glorious Food</em> and <em>Consider Yourself</em>, culminating in a fun and engaging ensemble performance.</p><p><strong>Cost: £450 | Suitable ages 10+ | Running time: 1 hour 30 minutes</strong></p>
    </div>
    


